# Day 4: Malam Itu (spec §2, beat plan last-seen-m2.md §5). Rebuilding Monday night minute by minute, Bima's
# confession, Didit's first call. Budget: 4.5k Indonesian words, about 28 minutes, to be retuned after the M1
# playtest.

@conversation d4_timeline chapter="Hari 4" chapter.en="Day 4" title="Malam Itu" title.en="That Night" checkpoint
@scene VN bg=bg_sekar_room_day.webp music=bgm_unease.mp3 day=4 time=08:10 textbox=nvl

narration
  id: Hari 4. Minggu, jam delapan pagi.
  en: Day 4. Sunday, eight in the morning.
narration
  id: Gue nggak tidur. Telepon semalem masih bunyi di kuping gue. Ombak, genset, dua klik.
  en: I didn't sleep. Last night's call is still in my ears. Waves, a generator, two clicks.
narration
  id: Dinda masuk ke kamar Sekar bawa satu pak kertas tempel kuning dan spidol. Dia nyabut beberapa foto nelayan dari papan gabus, hati-hati, kayak nyabut plester.
  en: Dinda comes into Sekar's room with a pad of yellow sticky notes and a marker. She takes a few of the fishermen's photos off the corkboard, carefully, like peeling off a plaster.

stage
  textbox adv
  show raka:neutral left
  show dinda:neutral right

dinda:neutral [right]
  id: Kak Sekar selalu bikin timeline kalau ceritanya ruwet. Kita bikin juga. Senin malem. Menit per menit.
  en: Sekar always made a timeline when a story got messy. We'll make one too. Monday night. Minute by minute.

stage
  textbox nvl

narration
  id: 20.40. Bima ngirim pesan, terus dihapus. Sekar bales "ok".
  en: 8:40 PM. Bima sends a message, then deletes it. Sekar replies "ok".
narration
  id: 20.50. Sekar nulis pesan buat gue. "Ka. Inget jam lima pagi itu? Gue masih di sana." Gagal kirim.
  en: 8:50 PM. Sekar writes a message to me. "Ka. Remember five in the morning? I'm still there." It fails to send.
narration
  id: 21.00. Pamit ke Dinda. "Dijemput."
  en: 9:00 PM. Says goodbye to Dinda. "Someone's picking me up."
narration
  id: 21.47. Foto pesisir_77 di TPI. Kapal Sri Rejeki di belakangnya.
  en: 9:47 PM. pesisir_77's photo at the fish auction. The Sri Rejeki behind her.
narration
  id: 21.52. CCTV. Turun dari mobil perak.
  en: 9:52 PM. The CCTV. Getting out of a silver car.
narration
  id: 22.40. HP utamanya mati, terakhir di sekitar Muara Angke.
  en: 10:40 PM. Her main phone dies, last seen near Muara Angke.
narration
  id: 05.30. Kapal ke Pulau Pari. Dilingkarin dua kali.
  en: 5:30 AM. The boat to Pulau Pari. Circled twice.

stage
  textbox adv

raka:neutral
  id: 22.40. Dia selalu bawa powerbank. Dulu dia ngamuk kalau baterainya di bawah lima puluh persen.
  en: 10:40. She always carried a power bank. She used to freak out if her battery went under fifty percent.
dinda:neutral
  id: Powerbank-nya dibawa. Gue udah cek laci. Yang ketinggalan cuma HP cadangan.
  en: She took the power bank. I checked the drawer. The only thing she left was the spare phone.
raka:determined
  id: Berarti HP-nya nggak mati sendiri, Din. Dia yang matiin.
  en: Then her phone didn't die, Din. She switched it off.
narration
  id: "HP bisa dicari," kata Pak Hendra. Sekar tahu itu duluan. Dia matiin HP utamanya di laut, dan ninggalin HP cadangannya di laci, buat orang yang bisa nebak sandinya.
  en: "Phones can be tracked," Pak Hendra said. Sekar knew that first. She switched her main phone off at sea, and left the spare one in a drawer, for whoever could guess its code.
dinda:hopeful
  id: Dia nggak ilang, Ka. Dia ngilang.
  en: She didn't go missing, Ka. She went into hiding.

narration
  id: Ada satu kertas tempel yang masih kosong, di antara 21.00 dan 21.47. Dinda nulis tanda tanya gede di situ.
  en: One sticky note is still blank, between 9:00 and 9:47. Dinda draws a big question mark on it.

evidence WHO_PICKED by=dinda:neutral retries=1 label=who_picked
  id: Siapa yang jemput Sekar jam sembilan? Tunjukkan buktinya.
  en: Who picked Sekar up at nine? Show the proof.
? bima_deleted
  +trust_dinda 2
  -> #picked_bima
? cctv_still
  +trust_dinda 2
  -> #picked_bima
? [retry]
  -> #picked_retry
? [fallback]
  -> #picked_guess

dinda:neutral label=picked_retry
  id: Itu nggak ngejawab siapa yang nyetir, Ka. Mikir lagi.
  en: That doesn't tell us who was driving, Ka. Think again.
-> #who_picked

dinda:angry label=picked_guess
  id: Udahlah. Kita sama-sama tahu jawabannya.
  en: Forget it. We both know the answer.
-> #picked_name

raka:determined label=picked_bima
  id: Pesannya dihapus jam delapan empat puluh, Sekar bales "ok", dan dua jam kemudian dia nanya "udah sampe?". Mobilnya perak, hatchback.
  en: The message is deleted at eight forty, Sekar replies "ok", and two hours later he asks "did you get there?". The car is silver, a hatchback.

dinda:angry label=picked_name
  id: Bima.
  en: Bima.
narration
  id: Dinda nulis namanya di kertas tempel yang kosong. Tulisannya lebih tebel dari yang lain. Spidolnya hampir nembus.
  en: Dinda writes his name on the blank note. Her letters are thicker than the others. The marker nearly goes through.
dinda:crying
  id: Dia duduk di ruang tamu kita, makan martabak sama Ibu, dan bilang dia lembur.
  en: He sat in our living room, eating martabak with Mom, and said he was working late.

# A threat Raka hid on Day 2 turns up here, on the phone Dinda is now reading too.
narration [if hid_threat == true]
  id: Dinda ngambil HP Sekar dari meja buat motret timeline-nya. Jempolnya berhenti.
  en: Dinda picks up Sekar's phone from the desk to photograph the timeline. Her thumb stops.
dinda:angry [if hid_threat == true]
  id: "Berhenti nyari. Demi adiknya."{w} Ini masuk Kamis malem, Ka. Jumat pagi lo bilang "kurang tidur".
  en: "Stop looking. For her sister's sake."{w} This came in Thursday night, Ka. Friday morning you said you "didn't sleep much".
raka:sad [if hid_threat == true]
  id: Gue nggak mau lo takut.
  en: I didn't want you to be scared.
dinda:angry [if hid_threat == true]
  id: Gue udah takut dari Senin! Yang gue nggak mau itu dibohongin. Sama Bima, sama polisi, sama lo juga?
  en: I've been scared since Monday! What I don't want is to be lied to. By Bima, by the police, and by you too?
set [if hid_threat == true]
  -trust_dinda 4
  set dinda_found_threat true

narration
  id: Ada yang ngetok kusen pintu. Bu Wulan berdiri di situ bawa piring pisang goreng, matanya ke papan gabus. Ke foto kapal biru-putih yang kita tempel di tengah.
  en: Someone knocks on the door frame. Mrs. Wulan is standing there with a plate of fried bananas, her eyes on the corkboard. On the photo of the blue and white boat we pinned in the middle.
wulan [offstage]
  id: Itu kapalnya Pak Karta.
  en: That's Pak Karta's boat.
dinda:neutral
  id: Ibu kenal?
  en: You know it, Mom?
wulan [offstage]
  id: Bapakmu dulu ikut melaut sama Pak Karta tiap Sabtu, sebelum sakit. Foto Sekar megang ikan di ruang tamu itu, diambil di kapal itu. Dia nangis dua jam karena ikannya mau dilepas lagi.
  en: Your father used to go out with Pak Karta every Saturday, before he got sick. That photo of Sekar holding the fish, in the living room, was taken on that boat. She cried for two hours because they were going to throw the fish back.
wulan [offstage]
  id: Pak Karta itu orang baik. Kalau Sekar pergi ke kapal itu, dia pergi ke tempat yang aman.
  en: Pak Karta is a good man. If Sekar went to that boat, she went somewhere safe.
narration
  id: Bu Wulan naruh piringnya di meja, ngelus foto kapal itu sekali pake ujung jari, terus keluar. Nggak nanya apa-apa soal kertas tempel yang tulisannya "Bima".
  en: Mrs. Wulan sets the plate on the desk, touches the boat photo once with her fingertip, and leaves. She doesn't ask anything about the note that says "Bima".
set
  set wulan_knows_karta true

dinda:neutral
  id: Telepon dia. Sekarang. Gue mau denger dia ngomong.
  en: Call him. Now. I want to hear him say it.

-> d4_unsent_replay [if heard_unsent_01 != true]
-> d4_bima_call


@conversation d4_unsent_replay chapter="Hari 4" chapter.en="Day 4" title="Dua Puluh Detik" title.en="Twenty Seconds"
@scene VN bg=bg_sekar_room_day.webp music=bgm_unsent.mp3 day=4 time=08:40

stage
  show raka:sad center

narration
  id: Sebelum nelpon Bima, gue turun ke tangga. Duduk di anak tangga yang paling bunyi.
  en: Before I call Bima, I go out to the stairs. I sit on the step that creaks the loudest.
narration
  id: Voice note dua puluh detik itu masih di sana, di bawah semua draf. Gue bilang nanti, kalau udah siap. Gue nggak bakal pernah siap.
  en: The twenty-second voice note is still there, under all the drafts. I said I'd listen later, when I was ready. I'm never going to be ready.

sekar voice=vo_unsent_01.mp3 [offstage]
  id: Ka. Ini konyol, gue ngomong ke HP yang nggak bakal ngirim apa-apa. Tapi gue butuh ngomong ke seseorang yang bukan Tasya, bukan Bima.
  en: Ka. This is stupid, talking to a phone that won't send anything. But I need to talk to someone who isn't Tasya, isn't Bima.
sekar voice=vo_unsent_02.mp3 [offstage]
  id: Gue nemu sesuatu. Sesuatu yang gede. Dan gue rasa ada yang ngebocorin kalau gue punya itu.{w} Kalau gue ngilang, lo tahu harus mulai dari mana.
  en: I found something. Something big. And I think someone leaked that I have it.{w} If I disappear, you'll know where to start.
set
  set heard_unsent_01 true
  remember heard_unsent_01

narration
  id: "Bukan Tasya, bukan Bima." Dia ngomong ke gue karena gue satu-satunya orang yang nggak ada di sekitar dia.
  en: "Isn't Tasya, isn't Bima." She talked to me because I was the one person who wasn't around her.
narration
  id: "Ada yang ngebocorin." Gue naik lagi ke kamar.
  en: "Someone leaked it." I go back up to her room.

-> d4_bima_call


@conversation d4_bima_call chapter="Hari 4" chapter.en="Day 4" title="Telepon Bima" title.en="Calling Bima"
@scene CALL channel=thread_bima day=4 time=09:05 bg=bg_sekar_room_day.webp music=bgm_tense_call.mp3 stay="Nggak. Dinda lagi denger. Dan Bima belum selesai." stay.en="No. Dinda is listening. And Bima isn't done."

bima voice=vo_d4_bima_01.mp3 [if bima_on_edge == true]
  id: Lo lagi. Mau nanya soal Senin malem lagi?
  en: You again. Here to ask about Monday night again?
  delivery: cold and tired, he's been expecting this
bima voice=vo_d4_bima_02.mp3 [if bima_on_edge != true]
  id: Raka. Gue udah nebak lo bakal nelpon.
  en: Raka. I figured you'd call.
  delivery: wary, forcing a calm voice
player
  id: Senin, jam sembilan. Lo yang jemput dia.
  en: Monday, nine o'clock. You picked her up.
bima voice=vo_d4_bima_03.mp3
  id: ...Siapa yang bilang?
  en: ...Who told you that?
  delivery: too quiet, a beat too late
player
  id: CCTV TPI. Mobil perak, hatchback. Dan lo nanya ke dia "udah sampe?".
  en: The fish auction CCTV. A silver hatchback. And you asked her "did you get there?".
bima voice=vo_d4_bima_04.mp3
  id: Oke. Iya. Gue yang jemput.
  en: Okay. Yes. I picked her up.
  delivery: after a long breath, giving up
bima voice=vo_d4_bima_05.mp3
  id: Dia minta dianter ke Angke. Katanya mau ketemu narsum. Gue nggak boleh ikut turun. Dia nyuruh gue pulang, dan gue pulang.
  en: She asked me to drive her to Angke. Said she was meeting a source. I wasn't allowed to get out with her. She told me to go home, and I went.
  delivery: fast, like he's rehearsed it alone many times
bima voice=vo_d4_bima_06.mp3
  id: Pesannya gue hapus karena kantor gue bilang jangan ikut campur urusan Sekar. Kalau ketahuan gue nganter dia, gue bisa dipecat.
  en: I deleted the message because my office told me to stay out of Sekar's business. If they found out I drove her, I could be fired.
  delivery: ashamed
bima voice=vo_d4_bima_07.mp3
  id: Jam sebelas gue nanya dia udah sampe belum. Maksudnya, udah ketemu orangnya belum. Dia nggak pernah bales.
  en: At eleven I asked if she'd gotten there. I meant, had she met the guy yet. She never answered.
  delivery: quiet, his voice catching
player [if clue_didit_card == true]
  id: Lo ngasih nomor HP Sekar ke Aditya. Bentang Pesisir.
  en: You gave Sekar's number to Aditya. Bentang Pesisir.
bima voice=vo_d4_bima_08.mp3 [if clue_didit_card == true]
  id: Pak Didit? Dia klien kantor gue. Dia bilang mau bantu nyari. Dia punya pengacara, Ka. Gue kira...
  en: Pak Didit? He's my office's client. He said he wanted to help look for her. He has lawyers, Ka. I thought...
  delivery: defensive, then unsure of himself

choice BIMA_PUSH by=bima timeout=10s
  id: Dinda duduk di kasur Sekar, tangannya ngepal di pangkuan.
  en: Dinda sits on Sekar's bed, her hands fists in her lap.
? "Lo bohong ke polisi, Bim. Ke semua orang." | "You lied to the police, Bim. To everyone."
  value push
  -trust_bima 2
? "Hari ini gue lapor ke Ipda Yusuf." | "I'm telling Inspector Yusuf today."
  value threaten
  -trust_bima 1
  set threatened_bima true
? (Biarin dia ngomong.) | (Let him talk.) [default] [silent]
  value listen
  +trust_bima 3
  set bima_leak_planted true

bima voice=vo_d4_bima_09.mp3 [if BIMA_PUSH == 'push']
  id: Gue tahu! Lo pikir gue nggak tahu? Gue nggak tidur dari Senin!
  en: I know! You think I don't know? I haven't slept since Monday!
  delivery: shouting, then hanging up mid-breath
system [if BIMA_PUSH == 'push']
  id: Bima memutus panggilan
  en: Bima hung up

bima voice=vo_d4_bima_10.mp3 [if BIMA_PUSH == 'threaten']
  id: Jangan. Ka, please. Kasih gue satu hari. Satu hari aja, gue yang ngomong sendiri ke polisi.
  en: Don't. Ka, please. Give me one day. Just one day, and I'll tell the police myself.
  delivery: panicked, begging
system [if BIMA_PUSH == 'threaten']
  id: Panggilan berakhir
  en: Call ended

bima voice=vo_d4_bima_11.mp3 [if BIMA_PUSH == 'listen']
  id: Gue sayang dia, Ka. Gue cuma pengen dia aman. Makanya gue... pernah ngomong sesuatu ke bos gue. Soal Sekar.
  en: I love her, Ka. I just wanted her safe. That's why I... once said something to my boss. About Sekar.
  delivery: slow, confessing, then he catches himself
bima voice=vo_d4_bima_12.mp3 [if BIMA_PUSH == 'listen']
  id: Bukan apa-apa. Lupain. Gue harus pergi.
  en: It's nothing. Forget it. I have to go.
  delivery: shutting down fast, scared of what he almost said
system [if BIMA_PUSH == 'listen']
  id: Panggilan berakhir
  en: Call ended

-> d4_after_bima


@conversation d4_after_bima chapter="Hari 4" chapter.en="Day 4" title="Malam Itu" title.en="That Night"
@scene VN bg=bg_sekar_room_day.webp music=bgm_unease.mp3 day=4 time=09:20

stage
  show raka:neutral left
  show dinda:neutral right

dinda:angry [if BIMA_PUSH == 'push']
  id: Dia nutup. Bagus. Sekarang dia tahu kita tahu, dan kita nggak dapet apa-apa lagi.
  en: He hung up. Great. Now he knows we know, and we got nothing else out of him.
dinda:neutral [if BIMA_PUSH == 'threaten']
  id: Satu hari. Kita lihat dia beneran ngomong atau kabur.
  en: One day. We'll see if he actually talks or runs.
dinda:neutral [if BIMA_PUSH == 'listen']
  id: "Pernah ngomong sesuatu ke bos gue." Lo denger itu, kan?
  en: "Once said something to my boss." You heard that, right?
raka:worried [if BIMA_PUSH == 'listen']
  id: "Ada yang ngebocorin kalau gue punya itu."
  en: "Someone leaked that I have it."

dinda:neutral
  id: Dia nganter Kak Sekar ke Angke, terus pulang. Jam sepuluh kurang tiga belas Kak Sekar jalan ke kapal Pak Karta.
  en: He drove Sekar to Angke and went home. At thirteen to ten Sekar walked to Pak Karta's boat.
dinda:hopeful
  id: Berarti narsumnya bukan Bima. Dan bukan orang PT.{w} Dia ketemu seseorang di kapal itu.
  en: So the source wasn't Bima. And it wasn't the company.{w} She met someone on that boat.

stage
  sound sfx_phone_ring.mp3

narration
  id: HP Sekar bunyi. Nomor yang sama yang ngechat kemarin malem. Bukan chat kali ini. Telepon.
  en: Sekar's phone rings. The same number that messaged last night. Not a message this time. A call.

-> d4_didit_call


@conversation d4_didit_call chapter="Hari 4" chapter.en="Day 4" title="Suara Didit" title.en="Didit's Voice"
@scene CALL channel=thread_didit day=4 time=09:24 bg=bg_sekar_room_day.webp music=bgm_tense_call.mp3 ring=sfx_phone_ring.mp3 stay="Kalau gue nggak angkat, dia bakal nyari cara lain buat ngomong. Mending sekarang, di sini, sama Dinda." stay.en="If I don't answer, he'll find another way to talk to me. Better now, here, with Dinda."

choice RECORD by=didit silent
  id: Di layar panggilan HP Sekar ada tombol merah kecil. Aplikasi perekam yang dia pasang sendiri.
  en: On Sekar's call screen there's a small red button. A recorder app she installed herself.
? Rekam teleponnya. | Record the call.
  value record
? Jangan. Dengerin aja. | Don't. Just listen.
  value listen

system [if RECORD == 'record']
  id: Merekam
  en: Recording

didit voice=vo_d4_didit_01.mp3
  id: Mas Raka. Selamat pagi. Aditya. Akhirnya kita bisa ngobrol langsung.
  en: Good morning, Raka. Aditya here. At last we get to talk properly.
  delivery: smooth and warm, a practiced public relations voice
didit voice=vo_d4_didit_02.mp3 [if didit_slipped != true]
  id: Tawaran saya kemarin masih berlaku. Saya orangnya sabar.
  en: My offer from yesterday still stands. I'm a patient man.
  delivery: friendly, unhurried
didit voice=vo_d4_didit_03.mp3 [if didit_slipped == true]
  id: Soal pesan yang Anda kirim kemarin. Saya harap Anda tidak salah paham dengan saran saya.
  en: About the message you sent me yesterday. I hope you didn't misunderstand my advice.
  delivery: smooth, but a little careful now
didit voice=vo_d4_didit_04.mp3
  id: Saya dengar Dik Dinda kuliah di Universitas Pesisir, ya. Semester lima. Kampusnya bagus. Lumayan jauh dari rumah.
  en: I hear Dinda studies at Universitas Pesisir. Fifth semester. It's a good campus. Quite far from home.
  delivery: pleasant small talk, which makes it worse
player
  id: Jangan sebut nama dia.
  en: Don't say her name.
didit voice=vo_d4_didit_05.mp3
  id: Saya cuma ingin semua orang aman, Mas. Mbak Sekar sudah dewasa, dia pilih jalannya sendiri. Anda belum terlambat untuk pilih jalan yang lain.
  en: I just want everyone to be safe. Ms. Sekar is an adult, she chose her own path. It isn't too late for you to choose a different one.
  delivery: reasonable, almost kind
didit voice=vo_d4_didit_06.mp3
  id: Serahkan HP itu, pulang ke Bandung. Berhenti nyari. Demi adiknya.
  en: Hand over the phone, go back to Bandung. Stop looking. For her sister's sake.
  delivery: soft and final, the same words as the threat, said gently
didit voice=vo_d4_didit_07.mp3
  id: Saya tunggu kabar baiknya.
  en: I'll wait for the good news.
  delivery: cheerful, then the line goes dead

system
  id: Panggilan berakhir
  en: Call ended
system [if RECORD == 'record']
  id: Rekaman disimpan, 01.12
  en: Recording saved, 1:12
  clue didit_call

-> d4_after_didit


@conversation d4_after_didit chapter="Hari 4" chapter.en="Day 4" title="Demi Adiknya" title.en="For Her Sister's Sake"
@scene VN bg=bg_sekar_room_day.webp music=bgm_unease.mp3 day=4 time=09:30

stage
  show raka:angry left
  show dinda:neutral right

narration
  id: "Demi adiknya." Kata yang sama. Pesan tengah malem itu nggak ditulis orang suruhan. Ditulis orang yang barusan nanya kabar kampus Dinda.
  en: "For her sister's sake." The same words. That midnight message wasn't written by some hired thug. It was written by the man who just asked after Dinda's campus.
dinda:neutral [if RECORD == 'record']
  id: Lo rekam?
  en: Did you record it?
raka:determined [if RECORD == 'record']
  id: Satu menit dua belas detik. Suaranya sendiri.
  en: One minute twelve seconds. In his own voice.
dinda:hopeful [if RECORD == 'record']
  id: Kak Sekar pasti bangga. Itu kerjaan jurnalis.
  en: Sekar would be proud. That's a journalist's work.
raka:sad [if RECORD == 'listen']
  id: Harusnya gue rekam.
  en: I should have recorded it.
dinda:neutral [if RECORD == 'listen']
  id: Iya. Harusnya.
  en: Yeah. You should have.

dinda:neutral
  id: Semester lima. Dia tahu semester gue, Ka.
  en: Fifth semester. He knows what semester I'm in, Ka.
dinda:crying
  id: Gue nggak bakal ke kampus minggu ini.
  en: I'm not going to campus this week.

narration
  id: Dinda ngambil laptop Sekar dari meja dan mulai ngetik cepet, kayak orang yang butuh tangannya sibuk.
  en: Dinda pulls Sekar's laptop off the desk and starts typing fast, like someone who needs her hands busy.
dinda:neutral
  id: Kalau Kak Sekar takut HP-nya diambil, dia pasti backup. Dasbor podcast-nya bisa dibuka, berarti akun cloud-nya juga. Sandinya sama polanya.
  en: If Sekar was scared of losing her phone, she'd have backed it up. Her podcast dashboard opened, so her cloud account will too. Same password pattern.
narration
  id: Sementara Dinda ngetik, gue inget satu kalimat lain dari kemarin siang. "Kalau ada yang menghubungi Anda soal HP itu, siapa pun, kabari saya dulu."
  en: While Dinda types, I remember something else from yesterday afternoon. "If anyone contacts you about that phone, anyone at all, tell me first."

-> d4_yusuf_report


@conversation d4_yusuf_report chapter="Hari 4" chapter.en="Day 4" title="Lapor" title.en="Reporting In"
@scene CHAT channel=thread_yusuf day=4 time=10:05 music=bgm_unease.mp3

choice REPORT_DIDIT silent
  id: Ipda Yusuf minta dikabari duluan.
  en: Inspector Yusuf asked to be told first.
? Ceritain soal Didit. Kirim rekamannya. | Tell him about Didit. Send the recording. [if clue_didit_call == true]
  value recording
  +trust_yusuf 4
  set yusuf_knows_didit true
? Ceritain soal Didit. | Tell him about Didit.
  value tell
  +trust_yusuf 2
  set yusuf_knows_didit true
? Belum. Polisi juga bisa bocor. | Not yet. The police can leak too.
  value keep

player sfx=sfx_msg_send.mp3 [if REPORT_DIDIT != 'keep']
  id: Pak, ada orang dari PT Bentang Pesisir, Aditya, minta HP cadangan Sekar dikirim lewat kurir. Barusan dia nelpon. Dia tahu Dinda kuliah di mana dan semester berapa.
  en: Sir, a man from PT Bentang Pesisir, Aditya, asked for Sekar's spare phone to be sent by courier. He just called. He knows where Dinda studies and what semester she's in.
player sfx=sfx_msg_send.mp3 [if REPORT_DIDIT == 'recording']
  id: Teleponnya saya rekam. Di akhir dia bilang "demi adiknya". Sama persis kayak pesan ancaman Kamis malem.
  en: I recorded the call. At the end he said "for her sister's sake". Exactly like the threat on Thursday night.
yusuf typing=4s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3 [if REPORT_DIDIT != 'keep' && lied_to_yusuf == true]
  id: Anda sekarang mau jujur ke saya, Mas. Baik. Saya terima.
  en: So now you want to be honest with me. All right. I'll take it.
yusuf typing=5s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3 [if REPORT_DIDIT == 'recording']
  id: Simpan rekamannya di dua tempat. Jangan kirim lewat chat. Saya ambil sendiri.
  en: Keep the recording in two places. Don't send it over chat. I'll come for it myself.
yusuf typing=5s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3 [if REPORT_DIDIT != 'keep']
  id: Ancaman ke keluarga itu bisa saya kerjakan, walaupun kasus hilangnya belum. Dik Dinda jangan ke kampus dulu.
  en: A threat against the family is something I can act on, even if the missing person case isn't yet. Dinda should stay away from campus for now.
narration [if REPORT_DIDIT == 'keep']
  id: Gue ketik, gue hapus, gue ketik lagi. Bima bilang dia kenal orang di Polda. Didit dapet nomornya dari Bima. Gue nggak tahu lagi pintu mana yang nggak bocor.
  en: I type, delete, type again. Bima says he knows people at the regional police. Didit got this number from Bima. I don't know anymore which doors don't leak.
narration [if REPORT_DIDIT == 'keep']
  id: Gue kunci layarnya.
  en: I lock the screen.

-> d4_notebook


@conversation d4_notebook chapter="Hari 4" chapter.en="Day 4" title="Catatan" title.en="Notes"
@scene CHAT channel=sekar_notes day=4 time=11:15 music=bgm_unsent.mp3 status=none

narration
  id: Akun cloud-nya kebuka di percobaan ketiga. Isinya foto-foto liputan, ratusan. Dan satu aplikasi catatan yang Sekar pake kayak chat sama dirinya sendiri.
  en: Her cloud account opens on the third try. Hundreds of reporting photos. And a notes app that Sekar used like a chat with herself.

timestamp
  id: Tiga minggu lalu
