sekar
  id: narsum mau ngomong. tapi cuma di laut. katanya darat banyak kuping
  en: the source will talk. but only out at sea. says the land has too many ears
sekar
  id: rekaman udah 2x backup. satu di laptop. satu yang gue bawa ke mana2
  en: recording backed up twice. one on the laptop. one i carry everywhere

timestamp
  id: Senin lalu
