  id: masih di sana.
  en: still there.

narration
  id: Dermaga kayu, langit oranye, laut yang masih abu-abu. Kapal biru-putih diiket di ujungnya. Persis wallpaper HP Sekar.
  en: A wooden jetty, an orange sky, a sea still grey. A blue and white boat tied at the end. Exactly like the wallpaper on Sekar's phone.
narration
  id: Bedanya, di pinggir foto ini ada bakau. Muara Angke nggak punya bakau lagi dari sebelum gue lahir.
  en: Except at the edge of this photo there are mangroves. Muara Angke hasn't had mangroves since before I was born.

choice DAWN_REPLY silent
  id: Bales?
  en: Reply?
? Ketik "kar?" | Type "kar?"
  value ask
? Jangan. Simpen fotonya. | Don't. Save the photo.
  value quiet

player sfx=sfx_msg_send.mp3 [if DAWN_REPLY == 'ask']
  id: kar?
  en: kar?
system [if DAWN_REPLY == 'ask']
  id: Dibaca 04.59
  en: Read 4:59 AM
narration [if DAWN_REPLY == 'ask']
  id: Dibaca. Nggak dibales. Kali ini, buat pertama kalinya, "dibaca" kerasa kayak jawaban.
  en: Read. No reply. This time, for the first time, "read" feels like an answer.
narration [if DAWN_REPLY == 'quiet']
  id: Gue simpen fotonya dan nggak ngetik apa-apa. Kalau dia di sana, dia tahu gue nerima. Kalau bukan dia, gue nggak ngasih apa-apa.
  en: I save the photo and don't type anything. If it's her, she knows I got it. If it isn't, I've given them nothing.

